      link "Migrating to v1 How to migrate to Bulma v1" https://bulma.io/documentation/start/migrating-to-v1/
    h3 Features
    row
      link "CSS Variables Customizing with CSS only" https://bulma.io/documentation/features/css-variables/
      link "Themes How Bulma styles its components with CSS variables" https://bulma.io/documentation/features/themes/
      link "Dark Mode Bulma comes with an automatic Dark mode" https://bulma.io/documentation/features/dark-mode/
      link "Color Palettes Input 1 color, Receive dozens of different shades for that color" https://bulma.io/documentation/features/color-palettes/
      link "Skeletons Transform almost any Bulma component into a skeleton loader, or use one of the pre-built utility elements" https://bulma.io/documentation/features/skeletons/
